Usage :
- For create/change any secret text make this:
- All file paths are relative to directory of script

$$  python ./updata_secret_text.py --help

Usage:
                updata_secret_text.py -a <address of your Jenkins server> -i <id of secret> -d <description of secret> -s <secret> -f <relative path of jinja2 template file with name>
Example :
                updata_secret_text.py -a https://jenkins.mysite.com -i "kuku" -d "key for slack" -s "ki4235343tsdgrki" -f "./secret_key.j2."

