- For create/change any secret text make this:
- All pfile paths are relative to directory of script


$$  python ./updata_ssh_key.py --help
Usage:
                updata_ssh_key.py -a <address of your Jenkins server> -i <id of secret> -d <description of secret> -s <relative secret file with path> -f <relative path of jinja2 template file with name>
Example :
                updata_ssh_key.py -a https://jenkins.mysite.com -i "kuku" -d "key for slack" -s "../KEYS/key_1.pem" -f "./secret_key.j2." -u "ubuntu"

